  "operative_text": "SECTION 1 (new): Notwithstanding sections 134-9, 134-23 to 134-25, and 134-27, it shall be unlawful for any person, including a guest, to store, keep, carry, or possess any firearm or ammunition in any hotel room assigned to a guest. For purposes of this section, \"guest\" and \"hotel\" shall have the same meaning as those terms are defined in section 486K-1."
